        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If application of Article XII (1) would result in employee(s) on the payroll on July 20, 1980 being laid off, then the following additional criteria will be applied in determining whether an employee who was formerly classified under the former Ann Arbor District Classification of Work and Wages or an employee who was formerly classified under the former Detroit District Classification of Work and Wages should be selected to be laid off:",
            "block_bbox": [
