                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If, and to the extent that, the location of the work performed by the employee(s) who would normally be laid off was routinely performed by employee(s) assigned to Broadway Station on April 9, 1979, then employee(s) who were formerly classified under the former Ann Arbor District Classification of Work and Wages will be laid off prior to employee(s) who were formerly classified under the former Detroit District Classification of Work and Wages.",
